START_MESSAGE_WITH_IMAGE=────「  ꜱᴛɪᴄᴋᴇʀ ᴋᴀɴɢ 」────\n✦ ʜᴇʏ <a href="tg://user?id={uid}">{first_name}</a>...\n╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌\nɪ ᴀᴍ ʏᴏᴜʀ ꜱᴛɪᴄᴋᴇʀ ᴄᴏᴍᴘᴀɴɪᴏɴ 💫\nᴡɪᴛʜ ᴍᴇ ʏᴏᴜ ᴄᴀɴ:\n➤ ᴋᴀɴɢ ꜱᴛɪᴄᴋᴇʀꜱ ɪɴ ᴏɴᴇ ᴛᴀᴘ\n➤ ᴍᴀᴋᴇ ʏᴏᴜʀ ᴏᴡɴ ᴘᴀᴄᴋꜱ\n➤ ᴍᴀɴᴀɢᴇ & ꜱʜᴀʀᴇ ᴇᴀꜱɪʟʏ\n╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌\nᴘʀᴇꜱꜱ ᴛʜᴇ ʙᴜᴛᴛᴏɴꜱ ʙᴇʟᴏᴡ ᴛᴏ ꜱᴛᴀʀᴛ

GROUP_START_MESSAGE=<b>Hello! I'm Sticker Kang Bot</b>\n\nI help you create and manage custom sticker packs!\n\n<b>Features:</b>\n✦ Create unlimited sticker packs\n✦ Add images, videos, GIFs as stickers\n✦ Manage and organize your packs\n✦ Share packs with others\n\n<b>Start me in PM to use all features!</b>

HELP_MESSAGE=For help and support, contact:\n\n<b>Support:</b> @Samurais_Support\n<b>Updates:</b> @Samurais_network

EXTRA_COMMANDS_MESSAGE=<b>Extra Commands</b>\n\nChoose a feature to learn more:

AFK_INFO_MESSAGE=<b>AFK (Away From Keyboard)</b>\n\n<b>How it works:</b>\nWhen you're away, set AFK mode and the bot will automatically reply to people who mention you.\n\n<b>Commands:</b>\n• <code>/afk</code> - Set AFK with optional reason\n• <code>/afk [reason]</code> - Set AFK with custom reason\n\n<b>Example:</b>\n<code>/afk Sleeping </code>\n\n<b>Auto-disable:</b>\nAFK automatically turns off when you send a message.

QUOTLY_INFO_MESSAGE=<b>Quotly - Message to Sticker</b>\n\n<b>How it works:</b>\nConvert any message into a beautiful quote sticker!\n\n<b>Command:</b>\n• <code>/q</code> - Reply to any message\n\n<b>Features:</b>\n• Works with text, images, videos\n• Automatically formats quotes\n• Creates instant stickers\n• Preserves user info & timestamp\n\n<b>Usage:</b>\nJust reply to any message with <code>/q</code>

STICKERS_INFO_MESSAGE=<b>Sticker Features</b>\n\n<b>Available Commands:</b>\n\n<b>1. Kang Stickers</b>\n• <code>/kang</code> - Reply to any sticker/image/video/GIF\n• Adds to your personal sticker pack\n• Auto-creates new pack if needed\n\n<b>2. Copy Pack</b>\n• <code>/copypack</code> - Reply to any sticker from a pack\n• Copies entire pack to your collection\n\n<b>3. Get Sticker Files</b>\n• <code>/getsticker</code> - Get static sticker as image\n• <code>/getvidsticker</code> - Get video sticker as MP4\n• <code>/stickerid</code> - Get sticker's file ID\n\n<b>4. Manage Packs</b>\n• Use "Manage Packs" button below\n• Rename, delete, add stickers\n• Publish packs for sharing\n\n<b>Supported formats:</b>\n✦ Images (PNG, JPG, WebP)\n✦ Videos (MP4, WebM - max 4MB)\n✦ GIFs & Animated stickers

MEMEFI_INFO_MESSAGE=<b>MemeFi</b>\n\nMemeFi allows you to add custom text to stickers.\n\nReply to a sticker and use the <code>/mmf</code> command.\n\n<code>/mmf Your Text</code>\nAdds text to the top of the sticker.\n\n<code>/mmf Top Text ; Bottom Text</code>\nAdds text to the top and bottom. Use <code>;</code> to separate the text.\n\n<code>/mmf -c Your Text</code>\nAdds text in the center.\n\nYou can combine top, center, and bottom text in a single sticker by using <code>;</code> and <code>-c</code>.\n\nText is displayed in a classic meme-style font with automatic wrapping.\nWorks with any sticker.\n\nAlternate command: <code>/memefi</code>

WELCOME_INFO_MESSAGE=<b>Welcome & Goodbye Messages</b>\n\nCustomize Messages\n✦ /setwelcome <b>reply</b>\nSet a custom welcome message when a new member joins.\n\n✦ /delwelcome\nRemove the current welcome message.\n\n✦ /setgoodbye <b>reply</b>\nSet a custom goodbye message when a member leaves.\n\n✦ /delgoodbye\nRemove the current goodbye message.\n\n\nEnable / Disable\n✦ /welcome on\nEnable welcome messages in the group.\n\n✦ /welcome off\nDisable welcome messages.\n\n✦ /goodbye on\nEnable goodbye messages.\n\n✦ /goodbye off\nDisable goodbye messages.\n\n\nAvailable Variables\nYou can use the following variables in welcome & goodbye messages:\n\n✦ <code>{ID}</code> – User ID\n✦ <code>{NAME}</code> – User's first name\n✦ <code>{SURNAME}</code> – User's last name\n✦ <code>{NAMESURNAME}</code> – Full name of the user\n✦ <code>{USERNAME}</code> – Username (or None)\n✦ <code>{MENTION}</code> – Mention the user\n✦ <code>{GROUPNAME}</code> – Group name\n✦ <code>{DATE}</code> – Current date\n✦ <code>{TIME}</code> – Current time\n\n\nExample\n✦ Welcome <code>{MENTION}</code> to <code>{GROUPNAME}</code>!\nJoined on <code>{DATE}</code> at <code>{TIME}</code> \n\n\nButtons in Messages\nYou can add buttons to welcome & goodbye messages:\n\n✦ <code>[Button](https://example.com)</code> – Single button\n✦ <code>[Btn1](https://link1.com) | [Btn2](https://link2.com)</code> – Two buttons in one row\n\n\nLimits\n✦ Maximum 2 buttons per row\n✦ Maximum 6 buttons in total\n\n\nNotes\n✦ Only group admins can manage these settings.\n✦ Text, media and buttons are fully supported.\n✦ Bot must be admin to work properly.


LANG_SELECT_MESSAGE=<b>Choose Your Language</b>\n\nSelect your preferred language:
LANG_CHANGED=Language changed to English
LANG_CHANGED_RUS=Язык изменен на русский
LANG_CHANGED_BUR=ဘာသာစကားကို မြန်မာသို့ ပြောင်းလဲပြီးပါပြီ

